{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat src/cart.ts src/money.ts README.md; git status --short; node --version; npm --version; test -d node_modules && echo dependencies-present; rg --files /private/tmp/claude-502 -g 'AGENTS.md' -g 'vitest.mjs' -g 'vitest.js' -g 'package-lock.json' | head -50\"","aggregated_output":"export interface CartLine {\n  sku: string;\n  name: string;\n  unitCents: number;\n  quantity: number;\n}\n\nexport const FREE_SHIPPING_FROM_CENTS = 5000;\nexport const SHIPPING_CENTS = 495;\n\nexport function lineTotal(line: CartLine): number {\n  return line.unitCents * line.quantity;\n}\n\nexport function subtotal(lines: readonly CartLine[]): number {\n  return lines.reduce((sum, line) => sum + lineTotal(line), 0);\n}\n\nexport function shipping(lines: readonly CartLine[]): number {\n  if (lines.length === 0) return 0;\n  return subtotal(lines) >= FREE_SHIPPING_FROM_CENTS ? 0 : SHIPPING_CENTS;\n}\n/** Cents as a price label: 1999 -> \"$19.99\". */\nexport function formatCents(cents: number): string {\n  const sign = cents < 0 ? \"-\" : \"\";\n  const whole = Math.abs(cents);\n  return `${sign}$${Math.floor(whole / 100)}.${String(whole % 100).padStart(2, \"0\")}`;\n}\n# shop-ui\n\nReact components for the checkout pages: `OrderSummary` (the totals box) and `CartPage`.\nPrices are whole cents. Shipping is $4.95, free from $50.00; an empty cart ships for nothing.\n\n```bash\nnpm install\nnpm test        # vitest run\n```\nv24.14.1\n11.11.0\n/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-alexander--claude-spares-spare-IwZtqC/50e3bfb1-34ed-4585-ad26-c678e31a5e93/scratchpad/agents-out/claude-code-heldout/react-component-bug/claude-code-2/repo/package-lock.json\n/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-alexander--claude-spares-spare-IwZtqC/50e3bfb1-34ed-4585-ad26-c678e31a5e93/scratchpad/agents-out/claude-code-heldout/react-component-bug/claude-code-1/repo/package-lock.json\n/private/tmp/claude-502/-Users-alexander--clau